{"seq":5,"slug":"southern-tour-talks","title":"南方谈话","stage":"DONE","category":"deng-xiaoping-theory","categoryLabel":"邓小平理论","chapterCount":3,"docCount":9,"url":"/c/leaders/deng-xiaoping-theory/southern-tour-talks","rating":{"composite":3.64,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.4,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":4.33,"strategic":3.5},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.05,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":2.25}},"hubDir":"/Users/wangyang.learnwy/learnwy/learnwy/l-doc-hub/hubs/leaders/02_deng-xiaoping-theory/05_southern-tour-talks","introMarkdown":"# 南方谈话 简介\n\n一九九二年初，邓小平以八十八岁高龄视察武昌、深圳、珠海、上海等地，发表了一系列影响深远的谈话，史称\"南方谈话\"。这次谈话在改革开放面临重大考验的关键时刻，重新确立了以经济建设为中心的发展方向，推动了中国改革开放的第二次浪潮，被誉为改革开放的又一个里程碑。\n\n本知识库适用于希望深入了解南方谈话历史背景、核心内容及深远影响的读者，包括党史研究者、政治经济学学者，以及对中国改革关键节点感兴趣的各类读者。\n\n全书共分三章，完整呈现南方谈话的前因后果。\n\n第一章**背景与契机**，深入分析南方谈话产生的历史条件。从一九八九年政治风波后的复杂形势到改革步伐的一度放缓，从国际共产主义运动的低潮到邓小平决心南巡的契机选择，全面揭示这次历史性谈话的深层动因。\n\n第二章**核心讲话**，聚焦南方谈话的主要内容与思想精髓。从深圳视察时关于特区经验的总结，到\"发展才是硬道理\"的经典论断，再到对姓\"资\"姓\"社\"问题的根本回答，逐一解读南方谈话最核心的思想贡献。\n\n第三章**历史影响**，系统评估南方谈话对中国此后发展的深远影响。从经济发展的再次提速到思想解放的新一轮推进，从社会主义市场经济体制目标的确立到对当代中国治理的持续影响，全面衡量南方谈话的历史分量。\n\n推荐学习路径为：先读第一章理解历史紧迫性，再精读第二章领会思想精髓，最后通过第三章认识长远影响。建议结合一九九二年前后的历史事件对照阅读，体会邓小平在关键时刻力挽狂澜的政治智慧。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"background-context","title":"背景与契机","docCount":3,"url":"/c/leaders/deng-xiaoping-theory/southern-tour-talks/background-context","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"political-turmoil","title":"政治风波与国际剧变","url":"/c/leaders/deng-xiaoping-theory/southern-tour-talks/background-context/political-turmoil"},{"seq":2,"slug":"reform-stagnation","title":"改革停滞与经济困境","url":"/c/leaders/deng-xiaoping-theory/southern-tour-talks/background-context/reform-stagnation"},{"seq":3,"slug":"tour-route","title":"南方视察路线与行程","url":"/c/leaders/deng-xiaoping-theory/southern-tour-talks/background-context/tour-route"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"core-speeches","title":"核心讲话","docCount":3,"url":"/c/leaders/deng-xiaoping-theory/southern-tour-talks/core-speeches","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"shenzhen-talks","title":"深圳讲话","url":"/c/leaders/deng-xiaoping-theory/southern-tour-talks/core-speeches/shenzhen-talks"},{"seq":2,"slug":"development-is-hard-truth","title":"发展是硬道理","url":"/c/leaders/deng-xiaoping-theory/southern-tour-talks/core-speeches/development-is-hard-truth"},{"seq":3,"slug":"market-vs-plan","title":"市场与计划","url":"/c/leaders/deng-xiaoping-theory/southern-tour-talks/core-speeches/market-vs-plan"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"historical-impact","title":"历史影响","docCount":3,"url":"/c/leaders/deng-xiaoping-theory/southern-tour-talks/historical-impact","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"economic-acceleration","title":"经济加速","url":"/c/leaders/deng-xiaoping-theory/southern-tour-talks/historical-impact/economic-acceleration"},{"seq":2,"slug":"ideological-liberation","title":"思想解放","url":"/c/leaders/deng-xiaoping-theory/southern-tour-talks/historical-impact/ideological-liberation"},{"seq":3,"slug":"legacy-assessment","title":"南方谈话的遗产评价","url":"/c/leaders/deng-xiaoping-theory/southern-tour-talks/historical-impact/legacy-assessment"}]}]}